values ('fq_merid_050', 'Liquidating the Drake', 'boss', 'S', 'MERIDIAN_CARTEL', 'SHATTERED_HEART', 'THE DRAKE LIQUIDATION EVENT. The Ashen Drake is the most valuable organic asset in the Shattered Heart. The Cartel board authorizes complete liquidation of all Drake assets. Raid Tier-1. Profit through liquidation. Quest giver: Don Vercelli at Port Meridian Cartel Headquarters.', '{"npc_id": "npc_cartel_boss", "name": "Don Vercelli", "location": "SHATTERED_HEART"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 49, "reputation_required": 2880, "required_quests": ["fq_merid_049"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "ASHEN_DRAKE", "count": 1, "desc": "COMPLETE DRAKE LIQUIDATION.", "description": "Defeat Ashen Drake (x1)."}, {"type": "kill", "target": "DRAKE_MINION", "count": 5, "desc": "Liquidate Drake Minion assets.", "description": "Defeat Drake Minion (x5)."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "drake_heart", "count": 1, "desc": "File complete Drake asset recovery sheet.", "description": "Collect drake heart (x1). [Item: Drake Heart]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 8000, "currency": 4000, "crd": 2000, "rep": 2500, "items": [{"item_id": "drake_heart", "quantity": 2}, {"item_id": "ancient_scale", "quantity": 1}, {"item_id": "con_elite_recovery_pack", "quantity": 5}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_merid_051', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_meridian.json', 49)
