values ('fq_shard_097', 'We Stand at the Threshold of the Shard''s Dawn', 'story', 'S', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'CRADLE_EXPANSE', 'The Cradle Expanse''s purification continues. Oracle Seraphel maintains the sacred vigil with the patience of someone who has given their entire life to a god that sleeps. The Abyssal Reavers return — not because the Children have failed, but because the void is what it is, and the sacred ground requires defenders who understand that constancy is itself a form of power. Quest 97 in the Children''s endless covenant: appear, clear, return, and appear again. The Shard''s awakening grows closer with every wave the Children dissolve. Quest giver: High Priestess Lyr at Sanctum Inner Chamber.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Oracle Seraphel", "location": "CRADLE_EXPANSE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 96, "reputation_required": 3245, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_096"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "AETHEL_ABYSSAL_REAVER", "count": 5, "description": "Sacred duty. [Aethel Abyssal Reaver]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 5000, "currency": 2500, "crd": 1250, "rep": 2000, "items": [], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_098', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 96)
