values ('ally_thane', 'THANE_ASH', 'Thane Ashborne', 'Legendary', 'DPS', 'A mythical Gravari berserker whose name is whispered in war camps across every sector. Thane channels volcanic fury through ancient combat rites, turning himself into a living weapon. His echo was sealed in a prototype core after a catastrophic battle that leveled an entire outpost.', 'The Crucible', 'STARFORGED_LEGION', '{"hp": 130, "mp": 90, "atk": 155, "def": 100, "agi": 105, "per": 110}'::jsonb, 'al_thane_pas', 'al_thane_act', 3, 60, 0.72, 4, 4)
