values ('ally_vael', 'VAEL_SHADOWBORN', 'Vael Shadowborn', 'Legendary', 'DPS', 'The Meridian Cartel''s most feared enforcer — a living ghost who appears and disappears across three sectors simultaneously according to intelligence reports. Nobody knows if there''s one Vael or many. Those who''ve tried to find out haven''t reported back.', 'Smuggler Jungle', 'MERIDIAN_CARTEL', '{"hp": 110, "mp": 100, "atk": 175, "def": 80, "agi": 155, "per": 110}'::jsonb, 'al_vael_pas', 'al_vael_act', 3, 65, 0.72, 4, 15)
